+<html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Desert scenery and sand — native game capture</title>
+<style>body{background:#172129;color:#edf1f3;font:16px system-ui;max-width:1280px;margin:28px auto;padding:0 20px}img{width:100%;display:block;margin:12px 0}button,select,a{font:inherit;color:inherit}button,select{background:#35434e;border:1px solid #778692;padding:8px 14px;margin:8px 6px 8px 0}a{margin-right:20px}p{line-height:1.5}</style>
+<h1>Desert scenery and sand</h1>
+<p>Actual native App race: fresh and cached world loading, ordinary driving camera and normal seeded wind. Captured on desktop; phone/tablet builds have not been updated.</p>
+<label>Renderer <select id="renderer"><option value="mobile">Mobile / Vulkan</option><option value="gl_compatibility">Compatibility / OpenGL</option></select></label>
+<h2>Restored pyramid</h2><img id="pyramid" alt="Restored pyramid beside the road after cached race loading">
+<h2>Wind-lifted sand at driving scale</h2><p>Toggle the effect in the exact same captured frame. The ground, camera, car and lighting stay fixed in this comparison.</p>
+<button id="toggle">Hide sand</button><span id="state">Sand visible</span><img id="sand" alt="Native driving frame with terrain-coloured windblown sand">
+<p><a id="motion" href="focused/mobile/motion.html">Actual sand motion</a><a href="report.json">Checks and source receipt</a></p>
+<script>let visible=true;const renderer=document.getElementById('renderer'),sand=document.getElementById('sand'),pyramid=document.getElementById('pyramid'),motion=document.getElementById('motion'),state=document.getElementById('state'),toggle=document.getElementById('toggle');function update(){const r=renderer.value;pyramid.src=r+'/pyramid-1--1.png';sand.src=r+'/'+(visible?'sand-in-race.png':'sand-hidden.png');motion.href='focused/'+r+'/motion.html';state.textContent=visible?'Sand visible':'Sand hidden';toggle.textContent=visible?'Hide sand':'Show sand'}renderer.onchange=update;toggle.onclick=()=>{visible=!visible;update()};update();</script></html>
